Package: pulzr-cellular
Provides: parkeze-cellular, pulzr-cap-cellular
Replaces: parkeze-cellular
Conflicts: parkeze-cellular
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Description: Cellular backhaul: a modem, a HiLink dongle or a tethered phone.
 Brings up the modem through ModemManager as wwan, or a USB Ethernet modem as
 usbwan, and keeps the gateway's own traffic on the metered link to the
 minimum that still allows it to be managed. Built into the image of a board
 whose modem is soldered on; an add-on everywhere else, offered once a modem
 is plugged in. See https://oss.pulzr.net/PulzrOS/backhaul.html.
